      "content": "but it's not just \"noise\" to me. it's everything. i try to find a reason to keep going, to keep trying to \"rebuild\" or whatever, but there's nothing to rebuild. the person who existed before this is gone. it feels like i'm just pretending to be alive, but the truth is that I've already been erased. i'm just a shell. it feels more logical than anything else, honestly. like, if the person i was is dead, why am i still dragging this around?",
